<title>USA: U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to watch - Nov 29.</title>
<headline>U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to watch - Nov 29.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>* Boeing Co might hire McDonnell Douglas Corp to supply it with commercial aircraft design, test and assembly services to help it deal with a sharp rise in orders, the Wall Street Journal reported.</p>
<p>* Music video network MTV Networks of Viacom Inc wants to get computer online services to pay multimillion-dollar fees or risk having their users blocked from viewing the network's site on the World Wide Web, The Wall Street Journal reported.</p>
</text>
